    "detailed_description": "<strong>JOIN my DISCORD to follow the Development:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469650/extras/ca2ee69e28c7661b4118b0ec89d28e2a.poster.avif?t=1727986324\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469650/extras/ca2ee69e28c7661b4118b0ec89d28e2a.webm?t=1727986324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469650/extras/ca2ee69e28c7661b4118b0ec89d28e2a.mp4?t=1727986324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>NOTE:</u></strong><br><strong>This game deals with HEAVY THEMES such as Severe Mental Illness, Suicide, Domestic Abuse, Torture, Sexual and Physical Abuse, and Neglect. \ud83d\udc94</strong><br><br><strong><u>THE PROLOGUE</u></strong><br>No Body is a story driven, action-turn-based RPG hybrid set in the present day. This is your First Look into what I've been creating for the last 2 years!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469650/extras/347fe78d2a12930248b53f1c40015702.poster.avif?t=1727986324\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469650/extras/347fe78d2a12930248b53f1c40015702.webm?t=1727986324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469650/extras/347fe78d2a12930248b53f1c40015702.mp4?t=1727986324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><u>GAMEPLAY:</u></strong><br>Clownface is your average 17-year old boy.\u00a0<br>He likes anime. He plays video games.\u00a0You know, the regular stuff.<br>He's also been haunted by a menacing presence for as long as he can remember.\u00a0<br><br>Play as Clownface, Marked, The Witch, Angel and T0B-13 and venture through The WELL, a bizarre and dangerous reality whilst making friends and destroying Anomalies. <i>No Body</i> is inspired by\u00a0UNDERTALE, Silent Hill, and a Night In The Woods, from its hand-drawn pixel and character art, odd humor, creature, world, and puzzle design, and focus on character and story development.<br><br>Travel through a vast semi-open world as you uncover the meaning of the WELL, complete puzzling side quests, discover secrets, and delve into tones of lore!\u00a0<br><br><strong><u>FEATURES:</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story and Character Driven Narrative!<br></li><li>Violence, abuse, murder, and revenge!<br></li><li>Original art and music!<br></li><li>Gameplay that spans multiple genres from visual novel, to turn based combat, to action combat and platforming!<br></li><li>Investigate inside and outside of the game!<br></li><li>Quirky, funny, and horrifying characters!<br></li><li>Deep\u00a0lore and mysteries to solve!<br></li><li>Do side quests and solve mysteries!<br></li><li>&quot;Zelda-like&quot; exploration!<br></li><li>Annoy your party members!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469650/extras/bc15ee2a63f807fbcdf966e8b3a5339e.poster.avif?t=1727986324\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2469650/extras/bc15ee2a63f807fbcdf966e8b3a5339e.gif?t=1727986324\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></li></ul>",
